{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/addEN.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blizzy has always been looking for adventure - the more dangerous, the better. Becoming a hero and saving the kingdom - this is what he could only dream of. And a trip to Hell is a great opportunity to get some fresh air and prove yourself. Is ancient evil breaking free? Nonsense! The young and fearless Blizzy can handle anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/art1.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game where you get the chance to complete four locations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice: The full version of the game will have professional voice acting in  English. (Demo have only Russian voice acting)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version will be available only during the &quot;Steam Next Fest&quot; festival (until June 16th).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Creepy Tale you will find many mechanics, including riddles, platforming, stealth, arcade mini-games and, of course, action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/featuresEN.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, story-driven adventure full of quirky characters and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique hand-drawn 2D art with frame-by-frame animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth segments and tightly wound, dynamic scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of puzzles and arcade-style mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack and immersive sound design.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3542280?t=1748547220","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/280d992e8aaa26eb12c1f7705f43e095081a05fd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748547220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/930939e81e9f50bf94c6c0d419758755885113d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748547220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/930939e81e9f50bf94c6c0d419758755885113d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748547220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/addEN.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blizzy has always been looking for adventure - the more dangerous, the better. Becoming a hero and saving the kingdom - this is what he could only dream of. And a trip to Hell is a great opportunity to get some fresh air and prove yourself. Is ancient evil breaking free? Nonsense! The young and fearless Blizzy can handle anything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/art1.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a demo for the full game where you get the chance to complete four locations!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Notice: The full version of the game will have professional voice acting in  English. (Demo have only Russian voice acting)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The demo version will be available only during the &quot;Steam Next Fest&quot; festival (until June 16th).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Creepy Tale you will find many mechanics, including riddles, platforming, stealth, arcade mini-games and, of course, action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/extras/featuresEN.png?t=1748547220\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A rich, story-driven adventure full of quirky characters and unexpected twists.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique hand-drawn 2D art with frame-by-frame animation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stealth segments and tightly wound, dynamic scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A variety of puzzles and arcade-style mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An original soundtrack and immersive sound design.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Creepy Brothers"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3529690","name":"Creepy Tale: Snow Child"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3542280/09b899048d24900e766cd5cbe055b1ea3557a76d/header.jpg?t=1748547220","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257123729,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123729/movie480.mp4?t=1748524709","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257123729/movie_max.mp4?t=1748524709"},"name":"Official Demo Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257123729/